{MESON "500"}
Natsumi<STYLE ID="1"> placed, beside </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s memorial photo, the memorial photo of </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">her dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
